config BEAU_STATIC_RPROC
	tristate "BEAU static remoteproc RPMsg transport"
	depends on OF && RPMSG_VIRTIO
	help
	  Attach Linux remoteproc to an already-running BEAU Zephyr service VM.
	  The transport exposes a static shared-memory resource table and a
	  hypervisor-routed doorbell. It never loads firmware or controls the
	  remote VM lifecycle.
